iders":[],"episodeGroups":[],"translations":[{"language":"it-IT","title":"Non c'è più religione","overview":"Nel presepe vivente il bambinello ha fatto lo sviluppo. Ha la barba e i brufoli degli adolescenti e nella culla non ci sta proprio. Bisogna trovarne un altro a tutti i costi! Una commedia sull'Italia di oggi, multietnica, senza figli e che si arrangia come può, con un lama al posto del bue e tre amici in lotta fra loro, al posto dei re Magi. Un presepe vivente così non si vedeva da 2000 anni nella piccola isola di Porto Buio.","tagline":"Una favola farsesca."},{"language":"en-US","title":"There's No Religion Anymore","overview":"Set on the small island of Porto Buio, the traditional live Christmas Nativity scene might not go ahead because the baby who’s always played Jesus has grown up and no new babies have been born on the island in years!  With this fundamental tradition on the line, newly elected Mayor Cecco (Claudio Bisio) wants to ask the local Tunisian community to “borrow” one of their children, but there’s conflict between the two communities. Cecco enlists the help of local Islam convert Bilal (Alessandro Gassman) to cross the cultural divide… but both communities are not sure what to make of a baby Jesus that may need his nationality, and even his religion changed!"}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/aQH5sSmieXLOmil1C6GbyNC1VAU.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/aQH5sSmieXLOmil1C6GbyNC1VAU.jpg","language":"it","width":1400,"height":2100},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/cal8v7pYgQDhiDl0ZxgYQWvWNBr.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/cal8v7pYgQDhiDl0ZxgYQWvWNBr.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k2t254VY66LmI9vaGnEeJuPSfjc.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k2t254VY66LmI9vaGnEeJuPSfjc.jpg","language":"it","width":1320,"height":1980},{"type":"post